From: MacVM validation <macvm@validation.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] reims: signal the refresh class selected by the guest

Different AppleParavirtDisplay generations arm different completion classes in
the same shared enable word. Signal VBL, transaction/present, or both according
to that live word. Share the exact implementation with the contended poll path
and carry the guest page size in its lock-free snapshot.
---
