 crates/reims-vgpu/src/runtime/drain/mod.rs      | 61 ++++++++++++++++++-------
 crates/reims-vgpu/src/runtime/drain/tests.rs    | 43 +++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 103 insertions(+), 48 deletions(-)

